*  earn0_cap_after_bal.sno - same mechanism, BAL arm (2026-08-11 s27).
*  BAL's CURSOR IS CORRECT (measured separately with @: cursor_after_BAL agrees
*  with the oracle on both 'AB+(14-2)*C' and '(X)Y').  Only the CAPTURE is wrong,
*  which is what makes this the capture-delta0 defect and not a BAL defect.
*  Here: BAL starts at p=3, consumes n=4 ('(cd)').  SPITBOL binds '(cd)'.
*  SCRIP binds [n, p+n) = [4,7) = 'cd)' -- PREDICTED IN ADVANCE, then measured.
        S = 'ab+(cd)ef'
        S ANY('+') BAL . R 'e'                   :S(Y)F(N)
Y       OUTPUT = 'R=[' R ']'                     :(D)
N       OUTPUT = 'NOMATCH'
D       OUTPUT = 'DONE'
END
